.el .ds Aq '
.TH HAYATE-MAN 1 "2026-07-04" "hayate 6.0.0" "Hayate Manual"
.SH NAME
man \- Print man pages generated from the CLI definition
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBman\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPAGE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print man pages generated from the CLI definition
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPAGE\fR] [default: hayate]
Man page to print. Use `hayate` for the top\-level page, or a subcommand name
(e.g. `send`, `receive`) for its dedicated page
